title: Plant
---
<<declare $plant_interaction_times = 0>>
<<declare $has_tomatoes = false>>

<<if $plant_interaction_times == 0>>
  It's a plant!
  To this day, you don't know what type of plant it is.
  Yet somehow, it's still alive.
  <<set $plant_interaction_times = 1 >>
<<elseif $plant_interaction_times == 1 and $plantLady_interaction_times >= 1>>
  It's a plant!
  You: Hmm, maybe I can gift this to Haruka?
  Pick up plant?
  -> Yes
    <<set $has_tomatoes = true>>
    <<Pickup PottedPlant>>
  -> No
  <<set $plant_interaction_times = 2>>
<<else>>
  It's a plant!
<<endif>>

===
